{
    "Notes":  "Dodga Demercel, Shoulderpads quest part 1 (AO-Universe). Turn-in of the 8 raw parts by trade is a stand-in for the retail combine chain (no tradeskill engine): guessed. Generated by ddogs/tools/Build-ShoulderpadsJunkyard.ps1.",
    "Npcs":  [
